  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "--- 9.0.1.2 ---\n\t\t\tAdded net11.0 target framework for .NET 11 support.\n\n\t\t\t--- 9.0.1.1 ---\n\t\t\tBugFix:\n\t\t\tCLong/CULong had incorrect size (on Windows or 32bit) and netstandard.\n\t\t\tThe nuget package contains a windows specific build for netstandard2.0 and netstandard2.1 to fix this issue.\n\t\t\tFor unix/linux it maps to IntPtr/UIntPtr, for windows targets it mappes to int/uint.\n\t\t\tAlso a _win struct is included if netstandard so that the general build has structs with correct size.\n\t\t\tCast to the correct type at runtime if necessary. (e.B. _AVIOContext(_win) FormatContext->pb)",
